ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261004/202610040336132937_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261004/202610040336132937_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【战报新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-04/match1949562date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">惨案！英格兰7-0克罗地亚 贝林1射3传凯恩2射1传萨卡双响戈登传射</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.58" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261004/zhanbao_image_1949562_1791049869_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.58" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.58" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261004/zhanbao_image_1949562_1791049869_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261004/zhanbao_image_1949562_1791049869_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>贝林厄姆1射3传，英格兰7-0狂胜克罗地亚，取得欧国联2连胜，同时送给克罗地亚2连败。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-04/match1949563date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">41场不败！西班牙3-1十人捷克 亚马尔罗德里破门奥尔莫献助攻</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.67" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261004/zhanbao_image_1949563_1791059879_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.67" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.67" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261004/zhanbao_image_1949563_1791059879_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261004/zhanbao_image_1949563_1791059879_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>亚马尔、罗德里、梅里诺破门，西班牙队以3-1力克捷克队。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-04/6ac14559815a1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">队史耻辱纪录诞生！克罗地亚0-7英格兰，创下队史最大分差的惨败</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-04/match2123495date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">友谊赛-巴西4-0印度 埃斯特旺传射 利诺替补梅开二度 佩德罗破门</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.59" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261004/zhanbao_image_2123495_1791043265_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261004/zhanbao_image_2123495_1791043265_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20261004/zhanbao_image_2123495_1791043265_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>埃斯特旺传射，利诺梅开二度，巴西4-0印度。</p><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-04/6ac1375de3009native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">B费：希望C罗不要情绪上头时做决定 不该在让国家队分裂时候离开</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.73" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261004/202610040114233065.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.73" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.73" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261004/202610040114233065_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261004/202610040114233065_720.jpg"> </div><p>葡萄牙对阵挪威的赛前，B费接受RTP 3采访再次谈到了C罗，希望他不要就此退出葡萄牙队。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-04/6ac1300874a8dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">B费：我告诉C罗他永远是葡萄牙最伟大象征 值得全体葡萄牙人尊重</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-04/6ac12c88882benative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">与C罗和解？热苏斯：C罗是葡萄牙象征，赛后我们会有充足时间讨论</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.73" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261004/202610040029288962.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.73" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.73" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261004/202610040029288962_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261004/202610040029288962_720.jpg"> </div><p>葡萄牙对阵挪威赛前，若热·热苏斯出席发布会，再次被问到C罗等话题。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-04/6ac1665ef124bnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">葡媒：C罗今晚将返回沙特，时间刚好是葡萄牙对挪威比赛时候</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/6abcc1ca9d3fb_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/6abcc1ca9d3fb.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260930/6abcc1ca9d3fb.jpg"> </div><p>据葡媒报道，C罗准备于本周日启程前往沙特阿拉伯，回归利雅得胜利。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-04/6ac1263c7dadcnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">组织方声明：因补偿等原因，部分布基纳法索国脚拒绝出战阿根廷</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.08" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261003/202610030356205028.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.08" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.08" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261003/202610030356205028.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261003/202610030356205028.jpg"> </div><p>组织方发表声明，表示因航班延误后，部分布基纳法索国脚因疲劳和经济补偿原因拒绝出战阿根廷。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-03/6ac1243fd0220native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">U23国足三位超龄球员张玉宁、吴曦、朱辰杰与安东尼奥合影留念</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.54" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261003/6ac1232cb0c32_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.54" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.54" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261003/6ac1232cb0c32_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261003/6ac1232cb0c32_720.jpg"> </div><p>张玉宁、吴曦、朱辰杰戴奖牌与主帅安东尼奥合影。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-04/6ac136052e5afnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">仅出战12分钟！马卡：巴萨愿冬窗出售巴尔德，但球员无意离队</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260822/6a89aeae1512d_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%