 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.73" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261004/202610040152102648.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_261004/202610040152102648.jpg"> </div><p>据葡萄牙媒体abola报道，葡萄牙前锋贡萨洛·拉莫斯妻子的社媒遭到C罗球迷刷屏。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-04/6ac1360f41939native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">C罗母亲点赞ins帖子：当人们指责一个孩子时，最先疼的是母亲的心</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261004/202610040209162353_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261004/202610040209162353_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261004/202610040209162353_720.jpg"> </div><p>C罗的母亲在Instagram上点赞了一篇长文，在争议中默默力挺儿子。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-10-04/6ac15972df65anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">布拉加主席：C罗退队是情绪上头的决定，放今天他绝对不会这么选</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.42" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_261001/6abd7a31be92e.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.42" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div